              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikaba mbu khunyanga yeneyo abakholi baIsaka nibeetsa nibamuboolela khumakhuwa keliyabo liamatsi elia bali nibayabile, nibamuboolela mbu Khunyoolile amatsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.32",
